ot prove product identity, hair material, geographical coverage or package entitlements; verify those from the source where relevant."},"Natural Hair Styling|Flat-Iron Styling":{"description":"Flat-Iron Styling is heat styling with a flat iron to smooth or shape prepared hair. The stylist checks the hair’s condition, prepares it for heat and works through controlled sections to create the agreed finish. Its distinctive focus is flat-iron shaping as a styling step rather than permanent chemical texture alteration. Clients receive a smoother or deliberately shaped heat-styled finish. It suits clients whose hair is suitable for thermal styling.","photoBrief":"Subject: Flat-Iron Styling — heat styling with a flat iron to smooth or shape prepared hair.\nRequired visible features: flat-iron styling context or verified result; smooth controlled sections; agreed shape.\nComposition: Show the actual care procedure in a clean African salon, with the relevant hair or scalp and the stylist’s hands clearly visible. A finished-hair portrait alone cannot demonstrate that this treatment was performed.\nAvoid: chemical relaxer application; a silk-press package assumed to be identical; unrelated extensions.\nQualification: Match this exact service or style; do not approve a photo merely because it belongs to the same category. A photo cannot prove product identity, hair material, geographical coverage or package entitlements; verify those from the source where relevant."},"Natural Hair Styling|Flexi Rod Set":{"description":"Flexi Rod Set is a curl set made with flexible rods. The stylist wraps sections around flexible rods, allows the set to dry and releases and arranges the curls. Its distinctive focus is the spiral or rounded curl pattern produced by flexible-rod placement. Clients receive a shaped rod-set curl finish. It suits clients wanting temporary set curls.","photoBrief":"Subject: Flexi Rod Set — a curl set made with flexible rods.\nRequired visible features: flexible rods i